   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0eb895ae08f67a936d77",
   "sourceHash": "0eb895ae08f67a936d77f88b417013b6cbf81f00d0e42f5fc6b597043046d7b1",
   "text": "Prakriti（体质）评估指导您的整个入住期间——每一项治疗、每一餐和每一项活动都与您独特的体质相契合。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
